Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.50,1:29:00.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,《驯龙高手》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Berk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's 12 days north of Hopeless and a few
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,degrees south of Freezing to Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's located solidly on the Meridian of Misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,My village。In a word：sturdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's been here for seven generations
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,but every single building is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.77,0:00:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have fishing，hunting，and a charming view of the sunsets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only problems are the pests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，most places have mice or mosquitoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most people would leave，but not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're Vikings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have stubbornness issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.49,0:01:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great name，I know。But it's not the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Parents believe a hideous name will frighten off Gnomes and Trolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like our charming Viking demeanor wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing here？- Get inside！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back inside！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.07,0:01:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！What is he doing out again…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing out？Get inside！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's Stoick the Vast，Chief of the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,They say that when he was a baby
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,he popped a dragon's head clean off its shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I believe it？Yes，I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What have we got？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gronckles，Nadders，Zipplebacks… Oh，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,and hordes of Monstruous Nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.13,0:02:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any Night Furys？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- None so far。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Light the torches！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，nice of you to join the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you'd been carried off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？Me？Nah，come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm way too muscular for their taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,They wouldn't know what to do with all… this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，they need toothpicks，don't they？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The meathead with the attitude and interchangeable hands，is Gobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have been his apprentice ever since I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，littler
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,We move to the moor defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.15,0:02:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll counterattack with the catapults.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.59,0:02:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？Old village。Lots and lots of new houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and that's Fishlegs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snotlout
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,The twins，Ruffnut and Tuffnut…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,And…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aww，their job is so much cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on。Let me out，please。I need to make my mark！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you have made plenty of marks。All in the wrong places.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，2 minutes。I'll kill a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,My life will get infinitely better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.67,0:03:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I might even get a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't lift a hammer。You can't swing an axe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't even throw one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，fine，but this will throw it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，now this right here is what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it… it's a mild calibration issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup，if you ever want to get out there to fight dragons，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,you need to stop all…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you just pointed to all of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.74,0:03:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop being all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:03:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sir，are playing a dangerous game…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,keeping this much raw Vikingness contained.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There will be consequences！- I take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sword，sharpened，now！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,One day I'll get out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because killing a dragon is everything around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Nadderhead is sure to get me at least noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gronckles are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Taking down one of those would definitely get me a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Zippleback…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exotic，two heads，twice the status.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,They found the ship！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Concentrate fire over the lower bank！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry up！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then，there's the Monstruous Nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only the best Vikings go after those.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have this nasty habit of setting themselves on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reload！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:05:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the ultimate prize is the dragon no one's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,We call it the…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Night Fury！- Get down！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jump！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,This thing never steals food，never shows itself，and…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,never misses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one has ever killed a Night Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mind the fort，Hiccup。They need me out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay！… Put！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hiccup，what are you doing？- Come back here！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I know，be right back！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mind yourself！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The devils still have some juice in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me something to shoot at。Give me something to shoot at.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！I hit it？Yes，I hit it！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did anybody see that？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do not let them escape！- Right！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and there's one more thing you need to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，but I hit a Night Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not like the last few times，Dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I really actually hit…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys were busy and I had a very clear shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It went down just off Raven Point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get a search party out there before…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just，stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every time you step outside disaster falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you not see that I have bigger problems？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Winter is almost here and I have an entire village to feed！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Between you and me，the village could do
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,with a little less feeding，don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,This isn't a joke，Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why can't you follow the simplest orders？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I，I can't stop myself。I see a dragon and I have to just…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,kill it。You know，it's who I am，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you are many things，Hiccup，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,but a dragon killer is not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back to the house。Make sure he gets there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have his mess to clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quite the performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've never seen any one mess up that badly。That helped！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Thank you。I was trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I really did hit one。- Sure，Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He never listens。- Well，it runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when he does，it's always with this disappointed scowl
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,like someone skimped on the meat in his sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，barmaid。I'm afraid you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.17,0:08:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,brought me the wrong offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ordered an extra large boy with beefy arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Extra guts and glory on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,This here。This is a talking fish bone！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you're thinking about this all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not so much what you look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what's inside that he can't stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for summing that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，the point is，stop trying so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,hard to be something you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want to be one of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Either we finish them or they'll finish us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the only way we'll be rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we find the nest and destroy it，the dragons will leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll find another home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,One more search，before the ice sets in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those ships never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're Vikings。It's an occupational hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now who's with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，… those who stay will look after Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll pack my undies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I need you to stay，and train some new recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，perfect，yeah。And while I'm busy Hiccup can cover the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Molten steel，razor sharp blades，lots of time to himself…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What could possibly go wrong？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，what am I going to do with him，Gobber？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put him in training with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，I'm serious。- So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'd be killed before you let the first dragon out of its cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，you don't know that。- I do know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，you don't - No，actually，I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，you don't。- Listen，you know what he's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,From the time he could crawl he's been… different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,He doesn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has the attention span of a sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I take him fishing and he goes hunting for… for Trolls！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trolls exist！They steal your socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But only the left ones。What's with that？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When I was a boy… - Oh，here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,My father told me to bang my head
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,against a rock，… and I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought it was crazy，but I didn't question him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you know what happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got a headache。- That rock split in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It taught me what a Viking could do，Gobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,He could crush mountains，level forests，…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,tame seas！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even as a boy I knew what I was，what I had to become…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup is not that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't stop him，Stoick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can only prepare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it seems hopeless，but the truth is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,you won't always be around to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.05,0:11:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's going to get out there again。He's probably out there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，the Gods hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some people lose their knife or their mug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not me！I managed to lose an entire dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，wow？I… I did it？Oh，I did it！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,This fixes everything。Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have brought down this mighty beast！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you，dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna… I'm gonna cut out your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,heart and take it to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a Viking！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to talk to you，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to speak with you too，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's time you to learned to fight dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Uh，you go first。- No，no，you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。You got your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dragon training。You start in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh man，I should have gone first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，cause I was thinking。You know，we have a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,surplus of dragon fighting Vikings but，…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do we have enough bread-making Vikings，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,or small home repair Vikings…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:16:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You'll need this。- I don't want to fight dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh come on，yes you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rephrase。Dad，I can't kill dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you will kill dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.39,0:16:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm really very extra sure that I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's time，Hiccup。- Can you not hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is serious，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you carry this axe，you carry all of us with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You walk like us。You talk like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,No more of… this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just gestured to all of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Deal？- This conversation is feeling very one-sided.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deal？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Train hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be back。Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'll be here，maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to dragon training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,No turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope I get some serious burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm hoping for some mauling，like on my shoulder or lower back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's only fun if you get a scar out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，no kidding，right？Pain，love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great，who let him in？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lets get started。The recruit who does best，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,will win the honor of killing his first
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,dragon in front of the entire village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup already killed a night fury，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,so does that disqualify him or…？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.09,0:17:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I transfer to the class with the cool vikings？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。You're small and you're weak，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,that will make you a less of a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll see you as sick or insane and go
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,after the more viking-like teens instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behind these doors are just a few of the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,many species you will learn to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The Deadly Nadder。- Speed：8，Armor：16.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- the Hideous Zippleback。- 11 stealth，times two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The Monstrous Nightmare。- Fire Power：15.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.49,0:18:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The Terrible Terror。- Attack：8，Venom：12.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you stop that！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And the Gronckle。- Jaw Strength：8.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Woah，woah，wait，aren't you going to teach us first？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I believe in learning on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today is about survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you get blasted，you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick！What's the first thing you're going to need？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A doctor？- 5 speed？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A shield？- shield。Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your most important piece of equipment is your shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you must make a choice between a sword or a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get your hands off my shield。- There's like a million shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take that one。It has a flower on it。Girls like flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oops，now this one has blood on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tuffnut，Ruffnut，your out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.49,0:18:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those shields are good for another thing。Noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make lots of it and throw off a dragon's aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,All dragons have a limited number of shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many does a gronckle have？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Five？- No，six.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，six。That's one for each of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fishlegs，out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup，get in there！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,So anyway，I moved into my parent's basement？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should come by sometimes to work out，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.83,0:19:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,you look like you work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snotlout，your done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So I guess its just you and me。- Nope，just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,One shot left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that's 6。Go back to bed you overgrown sausage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll get another chance。Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember，a dragon will always…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.66,0:19:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,always go for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,So why didn't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.05,0:20:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well this was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.07,0:21:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you just fly away？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，where did Astrid go wrong in the ring today？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.87,0:22:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mistimed my sommersault dive。It was sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It threw off my reverse tumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，we noticed。- No，no you were great。That was so Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.69,0:22:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's right。You have to be tough on yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did Hiccup go wrong？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.63,0:22:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Uh，he showed up？- He didn't get eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.51,0:22:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's never where he should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Astrid。You need to live and breathe this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dragon manual… everything we
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,know about every dragon we know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,No attacks tonight。Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait？You mean read？- While we're still alive？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why read words when you can just kill the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,stuff the words tell you stuff about？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.67,0:22:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I've read it like 7 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's this water dragon that sprays boiling water at your face
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.02,0:22:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,And there's this other one that buries itself for like a week…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，sounds great。There was a chance I was going to read that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,But now…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys read，I'll go kill something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So I guess we'll share？- Read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,All mine then？Wow。So，okay。I'll see you uh，… tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.39,0:23:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dragon classifications
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.48,0:23:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Strike class，fear class，mystery class.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.91,0:23:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thunder Drum。This reclusive dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,inhabits sea caves and dark tide pools.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,When startled，the Thunder Drum produces a
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,concussive sound that can kill a man at close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Extremely dangerous。Kill on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.91,0:23:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timberjack：This gigantic creature has razor-sharp wings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,that can slice through full-grown trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.06,0:23:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Extremely dangerous。Kill on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Skulldren：Sprays scalding water on its victim。Extremely dangerous…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.03,0:23:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Changeling：Even newly hatch dragons can spray acid。Kill on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.35,0:24:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gronckle，Zippleback，the Skrill，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.11,0:24:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bonesnapper，Whispering Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Burns its victims。Buries its victims。Chokes its victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turns victims inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.06,0:24:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Extremely dangerous… Extremely dangerous…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill on sight… Kill on sight… Kill on sight…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Night Fury。Speed unknown。Size unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.91,0:24:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The unholy offspring of lightning and death itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.01,0:24:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never engage this dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.24,0:24:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your only chance：Hide and pray it does not find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can almost smell them。They're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.93,0:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.97,0:25:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Take us in。- Hard to port.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.89,0:25:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The hell hounds gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.53,0:25:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hard to port.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.30,0:25:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you know，I just happened to notice，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,the book had nothing on night furys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.55,0:25:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there like another book？Or a sequel？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.67,0:25:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe a little night fury pamphlet？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.55,0:25:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Focus Hiccup！You're not even trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today is all about attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.68,0:25:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nadder's are quick and light on their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your job is to be quicker and lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.50,0:26:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm really beginning to question your teaching methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.07,0:26:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look for its blind spot。Every dragon has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.73,0:26:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find it。Hide in it，and strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.59,0:26:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you ever bathe？- You don't like it，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.58,0:26:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,then just get your own blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.80,0:26:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about I give you one？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.41,0:26:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blind spot，yes。Death spot，not-so-much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.46,0:26:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hey，so how would one sneak up on a night fury？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.50,0:26:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one's ever met one，and lived to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.46,0:26:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，get in there！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.99,0:26:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，I know but hypothetically…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.84,0:26:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch out，babe，I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.58,0:26:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sun was in my eyes，Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.39,0:26:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do？Block out the sun？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.09,0:26:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can do that。I don't have time right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.47,0:27:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Has anyone ever seen one napping？- Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.72,0:27:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.06,0:27:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Love on the battlefield。- She could do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.78,0:27:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,L-let me… Why don't you…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.25,0:27:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.69,0:27:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of a joke to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.78,0:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our parent's war is about to become ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.66,0:27:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Figure out which side your on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.27,0:29:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could of sworn you have…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.06,0:29:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.03,0:29:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，uh，… no，no，… no…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.47,0:29:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I… I don't have anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.06,0:33:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,And with one twist，he took my hand and swallowed it whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.56,0:33:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I saw the look in his face。I was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must have passed the word，because it wasn't a month
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.25,0:33:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before another one of them took my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.83,0:33:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't it weird to think that your hand was inside a dragon？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like，if your mind was still in control of it，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.21,0:33:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,you could have killed the dragon from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.88,0:33:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,By crushing his heart or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.85,0:33:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear，I'm so angry right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.06,0:33:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll avenge your beautiful hand and your beautiful foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.97,0:33:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll chop of the legs of every dragon I fight… with my face！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.62,0:33:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。It's the wings and the tails you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.59,0:33:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it can't fly，it can't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.18,0:33:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A downed dragon is a dead dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.63,0:33:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，I'm off to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.22,0:34:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should be too。Tomorrow we get to the big boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.33,0:34:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slowly but surely，making our way up to monstrous nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.14,0:34:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But who'll win the honor of killing it？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.10,0:34:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna be me。It's my destiny。See？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.71,0:34:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mom let you get a tattoo？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.72,0:34:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not a tattoo。It's a birth mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.75,0:34:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I've been stuck with you since
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.16,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,birth and that was never there before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.70,0:34:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，it was。You've just never seen me to the left side until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.21,0:35:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，toothless。I brought breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.32,0:35:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope… I hope you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.81,0:35:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，that's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.55,0:35:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got some salmon，some nice lcelandic cod，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.99,0:35:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and a whole smoked eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.30,0:35:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，… no… okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.95,0:35:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I don't really like eel much either.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.57,0:35:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。That's the good stuff。Aah，don't you mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.69,0:35:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll just be back here，minding my own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Its okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.06,0:36:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.75,0:36:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，that's not too bad。It works.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.31,0:36:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，no，no… ！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.68,0:36:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh my… its working！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.15,0:36:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，yes，I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.33,0:37:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today，is about teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.47,0:37:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，a wet dragon head can't light its fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.70,0:37:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The hideous zippleback is extra tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,One head breathes gas。The other head lights it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.39,0:37:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your job is to know which is which.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.37,0:37:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Razor-sharp serrated teeth，and injects venom for predigestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.15,0:37:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prefers ambush attack，crushing its victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.14,0:37:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you please stop that？！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.11,0:37:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that dragon shows either of his faces，I'm gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.97,0:37:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,There！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.16,0:37:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，its us，idiots！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.85,0:37:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your butts are getting bigger we thought you were a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.45,0:37:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not that theres anything wrong with a dragon-ass fig…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.88,0:38:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.13,0:38:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！… oh，I'm hurt！I am very much hurt！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.45,0:38:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chances of survival are dwindling into single digits now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.55,0:38:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Wrong head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.68,0:38:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fishlegs！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.95,0:38:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.22,0:38:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aww，come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.40,0:38:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back，… Back，back！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now don't you make me tell you again！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.45,0:38:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，thats right。Back into your cage！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.94,0:38:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now think about what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.03,0:39:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，sooo，were we done？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.03,0:39:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cause I have some things I need to uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.39,0:39:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep，I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.32,0:39:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:40:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was that？- How did you do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.31,0:40:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I left my axe back in the ring。You guys go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.55,0:40:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.16,0:40:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meet the Terrible Terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.83,0:40:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha！It's like the size of my…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.48,0:40:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oooh！… Get it off！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.65,0:40:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I'm hurt！I am very much hurt！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.43,0:41:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！He's better than you ever were.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.61,0:41:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.39,0:41:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh，great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.86,0:41:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.51,0:42:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup？Are you in there？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.30,0:42:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astrid，hey。Hi，Astrid。Hi astrid。Hi Astrid
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.33,0:42:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I normally don't care what people do，but you're acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.13,0:42:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.93,0:42:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I trust you found the nest at least？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.98,0:42:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.13,0:42:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.34,0:42:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you had a little more success than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.46,0:42:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if by success，you mean that your
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.10,0:42:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,parenting troubles are over with，…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.23,0:43:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,… then，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.12,0:43:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations Stoick！Everyone is so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.72,0:43:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out with the old，and in with the new，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.67,0:43:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one will miss that old nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.27,0:43:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,The village is throwing a party to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.11,0:43:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gone？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.33,0:43:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，yeah，most afternoons，but who can blame him？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.46,0:43:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，the life of a celebrity is very rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.52,0:43:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,He can barely walk through the village
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.85,0:43:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,without being swarmed by his new fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.57,0:43:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hiccup？- Who would have thought it，eh？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.69,0:43:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has this way with the beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay there，bud，were gonna take this nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.51,0:43:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we go。Here we go。Position three，no，four.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.84,0:44:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，it's go time。It's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.60,0:44:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，buddy。Come on，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.56,0:44:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，it works！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.68,0:44:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.54,0:44:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.67,0:44:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，I'm on it。Position four，uh，three.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.81,0:44:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！Go baby！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.21,0:44:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，this is amazing！The wind in my…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.56,0:44:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,cheat sheet！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.06,0:44:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.12,0:44:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.61,0:44:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，gosh！Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.74,0:45:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh no！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.20,0:45:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright。Okay。You gotta kinda angle yourself！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.63,0:45:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。No，no，no… come back down towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.85,0:45:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come back down… oww！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.33,0:45:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.34,0:46:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，no thanks。I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.39,0:46:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not so fire-proof on the inside，are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.32,0:46:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.50,0:47:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything we know about you guys is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.71,0:47:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，you're back！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.09,0:47:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gobber's not here，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.19,0:47:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.36,0:47:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.13,0:47:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You did？- You've been keeping secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.84,0:47:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.63,0:47:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just how long did you think you could hide it from me？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.18,0:47:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I… I don't know what you…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.20,0:47:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing happens on this island，without me hearing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.48,0:47:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，lets talk… about that dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.00,0:47:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.31,0:47:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was going to tell you，I just didn't know how to uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.38,0:48:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're not upset？- What？I was hoping for this！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.77,0:48:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ah，you were？- And believe me…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.69,0:48:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It only gets better。Just wait till you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.56,0:48:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,spill a Nadder's guts for the first time…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.85,0:48:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,and mount your first Gronckle head on a spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.74,0:48:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,What feeling！You really had me going there，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.63,0:48:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,All those years of the worst Viking Berk has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.32,0:48:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Odin，it was rough。I almost gave up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.87,0:48:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And all the while you were holding out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.81,0:48:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Thor almighty！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.46,0:48:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,With you doing so well in the ring…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.24,0:48:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,we finally have something to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.28,0:48:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I uh，I brought you something…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.01,0:48:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,to keep you safe in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.37,0:49:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.65,0:49:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mother would wanted you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.17,0:49:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's half of her breast plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.33,0:49:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matching set。Keeps her… keeps her close，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.85,0:49:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wear it proudly。You deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.72,0:49:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've held your end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.78,0:49:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should really get to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.74,0:49:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，good，okay，good talk。- Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.06,0:49:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you back at the house。Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.17,0:49:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for stopping by and…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.70,0:49:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The uh… breast hat。- I hope
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.11,0:49:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,you like the，umm，… the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.12,0:49:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.57,0:49:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way。I'm winning this thing！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.68,0:49:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Please。By all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.46,0:50:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,This time！This time for sure！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.09,0:50:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No，son-of-a half troll，rat-eating munch bucket…！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.18,0:50:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.54,0:50:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,So… later.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.30,0:50:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，oh！Not so fast！- I'm kinda late for…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.99,0:50:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,What！Late for what，exactly？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.48,0:50:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，quiet down。The elder has decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.42,0:50:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，you've done it！You've done it，Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.03,0:50:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get to kill the dragon！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.13,0:50:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.54,0:51:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！Yes，I can't wait。I am so…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.21,0:51:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,leaving。We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.57,0:51:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's pack up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.02,0:51:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like you and me are taking a little vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.54,0:51:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.09,0:51:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the… ？Uh，w… what are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.88,0:51:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.17,0:51:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one just get as good as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.60,0:51:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Especially… you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.71,0:51:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Start talking。- I… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.54,0:51:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you training with someone？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.79,0:51:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Training？I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.05,0:51:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It better not involve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.14,0:51:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，this looks really bad but you see，this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.38,0:51:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right。You're right。You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.07,0:51:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I… I'm through with the lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.85,0:51:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been making… outfits！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.03,0:51:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you got me。It's time everyone knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.77,0:51:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drag me back。Go ahead。Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.04,0:51:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oww。Why would you do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.57,0:51:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's for the lies！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.22,0:51:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that's… for everything else！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.93,0:51:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.42,0:52:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.74,0:52:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！Run！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.50,0:52:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！it's okay。It's okay。She's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.82,0:52:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just scared him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.13,0:52:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I scared him？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.98,0:52:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is him？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.59,0:52:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astrid，Toothless。Toothless，Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.84,0:52:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dut，da da… we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.78,0:52:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Woah，woah woah。Where do you think your going？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.29,0:52:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great Odin！Don't。Oh，this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.99,0:52:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup，get me down from here！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:52:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to give me a chance to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.71,0:53:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not listening to anything you have to say！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.83,0:53:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I won't speak。Just let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.42,0:53:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.68,0:53:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now get me down！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.35,0:53:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toothless，down。Gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.26,0:53:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toothless？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.10,0:53:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you？Bad dragon！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.46,0:53:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's uh，he's not usually like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.74,0:53:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.90,0:53:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toothless，what are you doing？We need her to like us！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.21,0:53:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now he's spinning！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.91,0:54:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for nothing you useless reptile！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.89,0:54:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I am sorry，I'm sorry。Just get me off of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.10,0:55:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，I admit it。This is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.80,0:56:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's amazing。He's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.19,0:56:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what now？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.39,0:56:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup，your final exam is tomorrow！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.84,0:56:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know your gonna have to kill a…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.80,0:56:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill a dragon…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.17,0:56:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.79,0:56:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toothless，what happening？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.70,0:56:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，what is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.84,0:56:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.88,0:56:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's going on？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toothless，you gotta get us out of here，bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.52,0:56:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks like they're hauling in their kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.25,0:56:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What does that make us？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.95,0:57:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What my dad wouldn't give to find this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.46,0:58:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's satisfying to know that all of
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.83,0:58:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,our food has been dumped down a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not eating any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.96,0:58:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,What… was that？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.03,0:58:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，bud，we gotta get out of here。Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.78,0:58:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，it totally makes sense。It's like a giant beehive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.00,0:58:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're the workers，and that's their queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.19,0:58:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It controls them。Let's find your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.00,0:58:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.16,0:58:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Not yet。They'll kill Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.78,0:59:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astrid，we have to think this through，carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.65,0:59:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup，we just discovered the dragon's nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.83,0:59:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,The thing we've been after since Vikings first sailed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.84,0:59:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you want to keep it secret？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.12,0:59:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,To protect your pet，dragon？Are you serious？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.43,0:59:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.09,0:59:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Then what do we do？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.66,0:59:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just give me until tomorrow。I'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.35,0:59:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.76,0:59:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's for kidnapping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.13,0:59:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's for… everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.63,0:59:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you looking at？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.45,1:00:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I can show my face in public again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.18,1:00:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,If someone had told me that in a few short weeks
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.46,1:00:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup will go from，well being… uh… Hiccup，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.22,1:00:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,to placing first in dragon training.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.23,1:00:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I would have tied him to a mast and
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.07,1:00:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,shipped him off。For fear he'd gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.02,1:00:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.71,1:00:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.18,1:00:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,And no ones more surprised or more proud than I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.60,1:00:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today my boy becomes a Viking！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.00,1:00:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today he becomes one of us！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.30,1:00:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be careful with that dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.93,1:00:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not the dragon I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.34,1:00:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you going to do？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.76,1:00:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.34,1:00:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.67,1:01:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astrid，if something goes wrong，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.07,1:01:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,just make sure they don't find Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.68,1:01:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will，just promise me it won't go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.30,1:01:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time，Hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.07,1:01:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knock 'em dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.57,1:01:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd have gone for the hammer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.07,1:01:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.50,1:02:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on Hiccup，give it to him！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.39,1:02:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is he doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.67,1:02:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay，it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.02,1:02:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.87,1:02:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop the fight！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.13,1:02:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！I need you all to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.39,1:02:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not what we think they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.05,1:02:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't have to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.15,1:02:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said stop the fight！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.14,1:02:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of my way！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.32,1:02:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.64,1:03:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.47,1:03:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.16,1:03:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Night fury！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.92,1:04:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，Toothless。Go！get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.04,1:04:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.32,1:04:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，dad！dad，he won't hurt you！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.76,1:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toothless，stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.52,1:04:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.48,1:04:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get him！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.55,1:04:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，please。Just don't hurt him
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.21,1:04:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。Don't hurt him
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.72,1:04:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put it with the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.94,1:04:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.50,1:04:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should have seen the signs.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.07,1:04:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad？- We had a deal！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.64,1:04:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know！We did，but that was before I…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.06,1:04:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,oh，it's all so messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.92,1:05:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,So everything in that ring… A trick？A lie？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.43,1:05:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I screwed up。I should have told you before now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.60,1:05:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take this out on me，be mad at me，but please，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.17,1:05:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,just don't hurt Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.00,1:05:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dragon？That's what you're worried about？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.74,1:05:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the people you almost killed？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.74,1:05:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was just protecting me！he's not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.14,1:05:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've killed hundreds of us！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.33,1:05:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we've killed thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.76,1:05:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,They defend themselves，that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.58,1:05:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They raid us because they have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.90,1:05:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,If they don't bring enough food back，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.75,1:05:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,they'll be eaten themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.76,1:05:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something else on their island，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.34,1:05:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad。It's a dragon-like…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.12,1:05:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their island？So，you've been to the nest？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.33,1:05:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did I say nest？- How did you find it？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.05,1:05:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，I didn't。Toothless did.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.65,1:05:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only a dragon can find the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.02,1:05:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，dad，no please。Its not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.81,1:05:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know what your up against.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.48,1:05:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like nothing you've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.37,1:05:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，please，I promise you。You can't win this one！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.99,1:06:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.60,1:06:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,For once in your life，would you please just listen to me！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.42,1:06:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've thrown your lot in with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.09,1:06:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not a viking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.26,1:06:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not my son！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.57,1:06:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready the ships！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.64,1:07:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Set sail！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.39,1:07:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,We head for Hell-hounds gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.00,1:07:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lead us home，devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.20,1:07:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a mess。You must feel horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.09,1:07:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've lost everything。Your father，
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.48,1:08:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,your tribe，your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.82,1:08:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for summing that up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.82,1:08:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why couldn't I've killed that dragon，when I found him the woods？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.44,1:08:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would've been better for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.24,1:08:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep，the rest of us would have done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.52,1:08:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，why didn't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.11,1:08:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.77,1:08:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.63,1:08:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's not an answer。- Why is this
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.53,1:08:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,so important to you all of a sudden？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.23,1:08:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I want to remember what you say，right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.59,1:08:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，for the love of… I was coward，I was weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.21,1:08:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't kill a dragon！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.87,1:08:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said wouldn't that time？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.33,1:08:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever，I wouldn't！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.79,1:08:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,300 years and I'm the first viking who wouldn't kill a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.68,1:08:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,First to ride one though.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.55,1:08:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,So？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.55,1:08:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't kill him because he looked as frightened as I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.85,1:09:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I looked at him and I saw myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.05,1:09:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet he's really frightened now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.18,1:09:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do about it？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.35,1:09:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.12,1:09:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good，but you've already done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.61,1:09:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then something crazy！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.53,1:09:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.08,1:09:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sound your positions！stay within earshot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.29,1:09:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，Stoick，I was overhearing some of
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.96,1:09:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,the men just now and well，you know，…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.77,1:09:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,some of them are wondering what it is we're up to here？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.77,1:09:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not me of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.86,1:09:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you are always the man with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.90,1:09:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,But some，not me，are wondering if
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.54,1:09:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,there is in fact a plan at all…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.74,1:09:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,and what it might be？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.71,1:09:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find the nest and take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.58,1:09:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。Send them running.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.68,1:10:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The old viking fallback。Nice and simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.24,1:10:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.42,1:10:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head to port.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.48,1:10:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're planning on getting eaten，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.15,1:10:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd definitely go with the Gronckle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.84,1:10:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were wise to seek help
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.14,1:10:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,from the world's most deadly weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.48,1:10:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.17,1:10:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I love this plan！- I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.67,1:10:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're crazy。I like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.25,1:10:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what is the plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.96,1:11:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not very encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.91,1:11:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I was wondering where that went.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.01,1:11:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay low，and ready your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.95,1:11:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.44,1:12:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，what are you…？！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.82,1:12:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay… it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.65,1:12:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.80,1:12:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna need something to help you hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.60,1:12:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we crack this mountain open，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.70,1:12:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,all hell is gonna break loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.11,1:12:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,in my undies。Good thing I brought extras.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.10,1:12:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter how this ends，it ends today.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.21,1:13:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that it？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.56,1:13:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've done it！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.81,1:14:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,This isn't over！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.27,1:14:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Form your ranks。Pull together！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.40,1:14:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get clear！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.54,1:14:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beards of thor，… ！what is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.37,1:14:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Odin，help us！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.75,1:14:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Catapults！Fire！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.55,1:14:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get to the ships！- No，nooo！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.65,1:15:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not that one… - I was a fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.91,1:15:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lead the men to the far side of the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.40,1:15:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gobber，go with the men.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.45,1:15:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I'll stay，just in case you're
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.96,1:15:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,thinking of doing something crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.46,1:15:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can buy them a few minutes if I give
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.11,1:15:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,that thing something to hunt for.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.04,1:15:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I can double that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.37,1:15:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here！- Oh，no。Here！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.45,1:15:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fight me！- No，me！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.39,1:15:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ruff，Tuff，watch your backs！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.06,1:15:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move，Fishlegs！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.20,1:16:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at us！we're on dragons！We're on dragons！All of us！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.38,1:16:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every bit the bull-headed stubborn viking you ever were.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.47,1:16:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fishlegs，break it down！- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.50,1:16:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heavily armored skull and tail made for
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.21,1:16:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,bashing and crushing。Steer clear of both.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.25,1:16:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Small eyes，large nostrils。Relies on hearing and smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.62,1:16:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Lout，Legs，hang in it's blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.77,1:16:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make some noise。Keep it confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.66,1:16:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ruff，Tuff，find out if it has a shot limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.15,1:16:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make it mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.18,1:16:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's my specialty！- Since when？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.15,1:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone knows I'm more irritating，see.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.08,1:16:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just do what I told you。I'll be back as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.61,1:16:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry！We got it covered！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.99,1:16:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fool！- Butto！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.31,1:16:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye，ya grendel！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.80,1:17:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，this thing doesn't have a blind spot！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.68,1:17:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,There！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.71,1:17:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go help the others！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.32,1:17:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，hold on。Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.68,1:17:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's working！- Yeah，its working！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.10,1:17:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've lost power on the Gronckle！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.01,1:17:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snotlout，do something！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.74,1:17:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm okay！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.48,1:17:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Less okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.89,1:17:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't miss！Whats wrong，buddy？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.27,1:17:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got something in your eye？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.29,1:17:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you're the viking！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.55,1:18:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.74,1:18:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got it，bud！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.86,1:18:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.44,1:19:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.45,1:19:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,for… for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.36,1:19:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah… me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.58,1:19:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have to go up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.13,1:19:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're vikings。It's an occupational hazard
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.40,1:19:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm proud to call you my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.91,1:19:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.03,1:19:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's up！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.65,1:19:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get Snotlout outta there！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm on it！- I'm on it first！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.45,1:19:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，let me drive！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.54,1:19:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't push me！- I'll push your teeth out！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.19,1:19:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I can't believe that worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.92,1:19:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Night fury！- Get down！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.23,1:20:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you get her？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.04,1:20:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.51,1:20:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,This thing has wings。Okay，lets see if it can use them！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.72,1:20:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think that did it？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.76,1:20:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he can fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.92,1:21:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Toothless，time to disappear！Come on，bud！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.43,1:21:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here it comes！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.31,1:22:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch out！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.65,1:22:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，times up。Let's see if this works.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.49,1:22:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Is that the best you can do？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.00,1:22:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay with me，buddy。We're good。Just a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.08,1:22:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold，Toothless。Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.79,1:23:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,No… no！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.24,1:23:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.65,1:23:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Son！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.79,1:23:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.94,1:24:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh son！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.06,1:24:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.61,1:24:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm s… I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.33,1:24:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.14,1:25:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's alive！you brought him back alive！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.13,1:25:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you… for saving my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.89,1:25:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you know，most of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.18,1:25:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Toothless.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.81,1:25:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Happy to see you too，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.00,1:25:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aawww，what… uh… I'm… in my house
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.76,1:25:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.13,1:25:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does my dad know your here？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.58,1:25:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，what，oh，okay，… okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.49,1:26:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toothless，no。Toothless！Aw，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.57,1:26:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Thanks，bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.43,1:26:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toothless，stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.91,1:27:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,C'mon guys。Get ready！hold on tight。Here we go！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.81,1:27:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.50,1:27:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew it。I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.44,1:27:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but you give it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.50,1:27:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what do you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.74,1:27:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey look，it's Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.05,1:27:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiccup！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.75,1:27:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It turns out，all we needed was a little more of… this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.16,1:27:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just gestured to all of me？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.18,1:27:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，most of you。That bit's my handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.60,1:27:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,With a little Hiccup flare thrown in.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.84,1:27:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think that'll do？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.40,1:27:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I might make a few tweaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.25,1:27:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's… for scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.16,1:27:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What… what，is it always going to be this way？Because…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.30,1:27:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.08,1:27:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.89,1:28:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Night fury！- Get down！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.13,1:28:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.90,1:28:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Berk…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.67,1:28:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It snows nine months of the year and hails the other three.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.02,1:28:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any food that grows here is tough and tasteless.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.10,1:28:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The people that grow here are even more so.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.88,1:28:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only upsides are the pets.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.42,1:28:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,While other places have ponies or parrots…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.54,1:28:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.08,1:28:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是伯克村
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝望谷向北航行十二天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达极寒地以南
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就座落在痛苦之经线上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的村庄 一言以蔽之 坚固
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有七代人的历史
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但每所建筑仍崭新如初
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.77,0:00:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打渔 狩猎 享受迷人的日落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的麻烦就是害虫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多地方有老鼠或蚊子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们有…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做其他人就逃了 可我们不走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是维京海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以顽固著称
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.49,0:01:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我名叫卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是个好名字 但好歹不算最差
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母相信骇人听闻的名字 能吓走山怪山精
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我们「迷人」的维京风度还不够吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这干嘛 - 回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,回屋里去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.07,0:01:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝 他怎么又出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出来干什么 回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是伟岸的史推克 部落首领
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他在婴儿时期
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾把一条龙的脑袋齐肩削去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信吗 能不信吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有些什么龙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨齿龙 奈德龙 双头龙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一群凶煞梦魇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.13,0:02:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有夜煞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目前没有 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,点燃火柱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入猎龙盛会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你已经被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 我吗 算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太强壮了 不合它们胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道拿我怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们需要牙签吧 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个语气不善 装着假肢的蠢蛋名叫嘉伯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就在他手下当学徒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我现在也不大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们转移到沼泽防御区
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.15,0:02:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那用弹弩反击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.59,0:02:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 这就是村庄老房子新的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,射击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是小鱼脚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻涕唠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,双胞胎悍夫奈和暴芙奈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅丝翠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的工作酷多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去 我要立功扬名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名声已经够响亮了 简直臭名昭著
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 只要两分钟 我要杀条龙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活就会一片大好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.67,0:03:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定还能找个女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你举不起锤子 挥不动斧头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至扔不了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认 但我可以用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我就说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是小小的校准问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝 如果你想出去和龙战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就必须改变…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你指着我全身上下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.74,0:03:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从头到尾都要改
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:03:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你在玩火
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我这块维京璞玉蒙尘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 后果很严重 - 我等着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,去磨剑 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天我要出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在这里杀死一条龙意味着全部
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条奈德龙能让我小有名气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨齿龙比较难对付
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,除掉其中一只肯定能让我交到女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于双头龙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,它属珍稀物种 双头意味着双倍地位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现我们的船了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中火力攻打低岸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,射击
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有凶煞梦魇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有维京精英才敢捕杀它们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们喜欢让自己着火
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:05:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但终极战利品是谁都没见过的龙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称之为…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夜煞 - 趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种龙不偷粮食 从不露面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从不失手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人杀过夜煞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才要成为第一个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意堡垒 卡嗝 我要出去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这 别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就待那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡嗝 你在做什么 - 回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些怪物还有点力气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个射击的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打中了吗 我打中了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没说你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别让它们跑了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喷不出火了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事没告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我打中了一条夜煞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次和以前不同 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的打中了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时你们在忙 我一击即中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它掉到黑暗角去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要派搜寻队去…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次你一出来就会引起灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还嫌我的麻烦不够多吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,冬天就要来了 我得养活一村子人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句知心话 村里的人少吃点也没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不这么觉得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是开玩笑 卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么简单的命令 你怎么就不听呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不了 我一看到龙就想杀了它
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本性如此 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做很多事 卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对杀不了龙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,回屋里去 带他回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理他惹的麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没见过比这更糟的了 真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,承蒙夸奖 我继续努力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的打中了 - 当然 卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他从不听我说 - 那是家族遗传
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不就满脸失望和愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有人克扣了他三文治上的肉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 女侍 恐怕你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.17,0:08:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄错我想要的儿子了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我点的是肌肉发达的大个子男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要有勇气和荣誉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个却是会说话的鱼骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全想错了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和你的外表无关
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能忍受的是你的内在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的总结
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是这不适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再勉为其难了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想成为你们当中的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不消灭它们 就会被它们消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是除掉它们的唯一办法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到并毁掉龙的巢穴 它们就会离开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会去寻找另一个家园
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁海水结冰前我们再搜寻一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些船只会有去无回
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是维京海盗 这是职业病
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁愿意和我去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 留下来的人负责照顾卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去收拾我的底衣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你留下训练新兵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我在忙时卡嗝可以看店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,溶铁 磨刀片 还有很多时间独处
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会出事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿他怎么办 嘉伯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他和其他人一起训练
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是认真的 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没放龙出来 他就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可不一定 - 我很肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你弄错了 - 我不会错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你错了 - 你知道他的德性
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他会爬起他就与众不同
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从不听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意力持续时间比麻雀还短
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带他去打渔 他却跑去猎山精
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,山精的确存在 它们会偷袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可只偷左脚的 为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我小时候… - 又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲让我拿头撞石头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照做了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这不合理 但我没质疑他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道后来怎么样了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你患上头痛 - 石头裂成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从此知道了维京海盗的能力 嘉伯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能摧毁大山 移平森林
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驭海洋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就知道自己的能力和责任
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝却不是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止不了他 史推克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能帮他作好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不中听 但事实是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能永远保护他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.05,0:11:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还会出去 可能现在已经出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明都不眷顾我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人丢了刀 有人丢杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却丢了一条龙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了吗 我真的成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下一切问题都解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打败了这只凶兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 龙先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要挖出你的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拿去给我的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一名维京海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是维京海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话和你说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要和你谈谈 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候让你学习和龙战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和龙战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先说 - 不 你先说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如你所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,降龙训练 明天早上开始
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我应该先说的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多降龙维京人 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有足够的维京面包师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是维京修屋工
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:16:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会需要这个的 - 我不想和龙战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别胡扯了 你很想的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧 爸爸 我不能杀龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你一定得杀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.39,0:16:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我确定肯定以及一定我不会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是时候了 卡嗝 - 你听不到我说的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是开玩笑 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你拿起这把斧子 你就与我们同在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们一样行走 像我们一样交流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们一样思考
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再像…这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指着我的全身
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说定了吗 - 你都不听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力训练
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的 也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在这的 可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到驯龙场
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,无路可退了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望狠狠烧它们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我肩膀或者腰上有把大槌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 留下伤疤就有意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛 伤痛 我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了 谁让他进来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧 表现最佳的新兵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,将有幸在全村人面前
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲手屠龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝都已经杀了一条夜煞了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说他失去资格还是…？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.09,0:17:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能转到与真正的维京人一个班？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 你个子小又单薄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最不容易被攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会以为你是病患或者疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,转而进攻那些维京少年
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这扇门后面藏着不同种的龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要学会如何击败它们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 致命奈德龙 - 速度 8 护甲 16
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凶恶双头龙 - 隐身11秒 可隐身两次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凶煞梦魇 - 喷火攻击 15
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.49,0:18:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 极度恐怖 - 攻击力 8 毒液附加 12
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有巨齿龙 - 下颚攻击力 8
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你不先教教我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为 实战出真理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是生存训练
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,被撞倒就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快 你首先最需要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 医生？- 速度值加5？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盾？- 盾 去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果在盾与剑之间选择
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要优先选择盾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起盾牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的盾 - 那里还有好多盾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿那个 上面有花 女孩子都喜欢花
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这上面有血花了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍夫奈和暴芙奈 你俩出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.49,0:18:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些盾还有一个用途 干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,虚虚实实 躲开龙的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,每条龙都有攻击次数限制
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨齿龙能攻击几次？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五次？- 不 六次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 六次 正好你们六个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鱼脚 出局
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝 躲进去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 我搬到地窖里了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空你该过来练习一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.83,0:19:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要练习
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻涕唠 你出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像就剩我俩了 - 不 只有你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一击
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,六击结束 回去睡觉吧 你这头肥猪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有机会 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 龙 总是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.66,0:19:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,无时无刻地寻求杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.05,0:20:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.07,0:21:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不飞走
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅丝翠 你今天的问题出在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.87,0:22:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,俯身时机不对 太草率
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看穿了我的翻身
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们注意到了 - 不 做得好 这就是你的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.69,0:22:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对 你得坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝的问题出在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.63,0:22:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他就不该来吗 - 他居然没被吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.51,0:22:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来都找不准位置
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 雅丝翠 你们得慢慢消化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,驯龙图鉴… 这里面包含
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有我们所知的龙的种类
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜龙不会进攻 赶紧看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 你是说看书？- 在有生之年？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然能屠龙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,读书有何用？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.67,0:22:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读了有七遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说水龙会把沸水喷射到你脸上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.02,0:22:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说有一种龙能把自己埋上一周
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错 有机会我会拜读
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看吧 我找些东西试手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们一起看吗 - 你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就剩我了？好 我们…明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.39,0:23:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙族分类
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.48,0:23:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击型 恐惧型 魔法型
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.91,0:23:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷鼓龙 隐匿型龙种
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,栖息于海蚀洞与黑色潮汐塘中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,受惊吓时会发出震荡波
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,近距离接触会导致死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,极度危险 格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.91,0:23:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伐木龙 此种巨龙拥有剃刀型龙翼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能将苍天大树一劈为二
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.06,0:23:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,极度危险 格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,颅骨龙 喷出沸水伤害猎物 极度危险…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.03,0:23:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小丑龙 即使幼龙也能喷射酸液 格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.35,0:24:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨齿龙 双头龙 刺龙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.11,0:24:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,碎骨龙 致命耳语龙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死猎物 活埋猎物 掐死猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,将猎物内脏取出
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.06,0:24:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,极度危险 极度危险
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,格杀勿论 格杀勿论 格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜煞 速度未知 体长未知
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.91,0:24:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神与死神的邪恶后裔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.01,0:24:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,万万不可与之交手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.24,0:24:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,倘若遭遇 伺机隐藏 祈福保命
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们接近了 我可以感觉得到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.93,0:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把定
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.97,0:25:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开进去 - 左满舵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.89,0:25:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱犬之门
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.53,0:25:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,左满舵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.30,0:25:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我刚好发现
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,书上没有关于夜煞的记载
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.55,0:25:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有其它图鉴 或者续篇
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.67,0:25:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者关于夜煞的小册子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.55,0:25:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 卡嗝 你怎么心不在焉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天训练如何攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.68,0:25:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈德龙步行时快而轻盈
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须更胜一筹才行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.50,0:26:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我质疑你的教学水平
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.07,0:26:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找它的盲点 每条龙都有盲点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.73,0:26:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到盲点 以此躲避 再伺机攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.59,0:26:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不洗澡的吗 - 要是不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.58,0:26:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.80,0:26:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你来一下如何
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.41,0:26:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,盲点 有 死穴 不多
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.46,0:26:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么偷偷接近夜煞？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.50,0:26:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人见过 就算见到了也活不下来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.46,0:26:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 给我进去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.99,0:26:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 只是假设而已…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.84,0:26:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 宝贝儿 我来对付
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.58,0:26:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光太刺眼了 雅丝翠
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.39,0:26:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能怎样 遮住太阳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.09,0:26:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做到 但现在没时间
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.47,0:27:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人见过龙打盹吗 - 卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.72,0:27:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.06,0:27:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 战场上爱的火花 - 她能行的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.78,0:27:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来…你为什么不…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.25,0:27:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮 雅丝翠
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.69,0:27:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在儿戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.78,0:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迟早要接过父辈的旗帜
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.66,0:27:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,想清楚你站在哪边
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没牙齿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.27,0:29:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明明记得你应该有…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.06,0:29:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.03,0:29:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.47,0:29:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我没有鱼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.06,0:33:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着它一转身 一口咬下我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.56,0:33:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,从它的眼神我知道 我一定很美味
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定跟其它龙说过 因为一个月内
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.25,0:33:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一条龙吃了我的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.83,0:33:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手在龙腹中感觉不奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你的大脑依然可以控制它
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.21,0:33:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大可从龙腹里把它宰了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.88,0:33:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把龙心碾碎 或者怎么怎么的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.85,0:33:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我现在生气极了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.06,0:33:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要为你的手脚报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.97,0:33:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会砍下所遇到每条龙的腿…认真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.62,0:33:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要砍的是龙翼和龙尾
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.59,0:33:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它飞不了 就无路可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.18,0:33:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能飞的龙 就是死龙一条
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.63,0:33:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.22,0:34:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也早点睡 明天要对付大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.33,0:34:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然进步缓慢 但我们还是到了凶煞梦魇
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.14,0:34:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能有幸宰了它呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.10,0:34:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是我 这是命 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.71,0:34:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈同意你纹身吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.72,0:34:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是纹身 是胎记
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.75,0:34:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出生时我就跟你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.16,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.70,0:34:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没从左边看而已
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.21,0:35:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙 我给你带了早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.32,0:35:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…希望你有胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.81,0:35:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这挺恶心的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.55,0:35:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了些鲑鱼 一些美味的冰岛鳕鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.99,0:35:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有整条熏鳗鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.30,0:35:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吗 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.95,0:35:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我也不怎么喜欢鳗鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.57,0:35:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 这样很好 忽视我的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.69,0:35:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是来这关心我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.06,0:36:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.75,0:36:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定 不差嘛 挺有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.31,0:36:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.68,0:36:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.15,0:36:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.33,0:37:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天练习团队配合
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.47,0:37:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙头要是被淋湿 他就不能喷火了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.70,0:37:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶恶双头龙极度狡猾
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个头喷气 一个头点火
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.39,0:37:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要分出龙头的功能
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.37,0:37:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,锋利的牙齿 喷射出毒液 来腐蚀食物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.15,0:37:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,更喜欢伏击 踩碎食物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.14,0:37:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.11,0:37:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管哪个龙头出现 我都要…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.97,0:37:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.16,0:37:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们 白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.85,0:37:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你屁股越来越挺了 我们看成龙了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.45,0:37:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那曲线看起来就像是龙屁…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.88,0:38:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.13,0:38:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受伤了 我很受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.45,0:38:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存几率微乎其微
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.55,0:38:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个头
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.68,0:38:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鱼脚
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.95,0:38:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在 卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.22,0:38:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.40,0:38:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 退后
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我话不说两遍
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.45,0:38:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 回到洞里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.94,0:38:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好反省一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.03,0:39:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 训练结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.03,0:39:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有事要去…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.39,0:39:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.32,0:39:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:40:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么情况 - 你怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.31,0:40:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把斧子留在竞技场了 你们先走
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.55,0:40:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回头再找你们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.16,0:40:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来会会极度恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.83,0:40:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 这大小就好像我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.48,0:40:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄掉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.65,0:40:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼 疼死了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.43,0:41:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可比你强多了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.61,0:41:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.39,0:41:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.86,0:41:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.51,0:42:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝 是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.30,0:42:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅丝翠 嗨 雅丝翠 你好呀
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.33,0:42:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般不多管别人闲事 但你的举止真是很诡异
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.13,0:42:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 更诡异了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.93,0:42:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好歹找到了巢穴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.98,0:42:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,连影子都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.13,0:42:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.34,0:42:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你这里有点好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.46,0:42:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的好消息是指
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.10,0:42:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为家长不用再头痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.23,0:43:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.12,0:43:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 史推克 大家都松了口气
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.72,0:43:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头到尾 焕然一新哈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.67,0:43:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会想念以前那个旧麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.27,0:43:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,村子要举办一场晚会来庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.11,0:43:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.33,0:43:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午一般都不在 但这又不能怪他
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.46,0:43:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 做一个名人可不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.52,0:43:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在每次经过村子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.85,0:43:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,都被一群新粉丝围堵
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.57,0:43:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡嗝？- 谁会想到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.69,0:43:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对付那群野兽自有一套
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计 我们要飞得更慢更稳些
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.51,0:43:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 三号 不 四号位置
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.84,0:44:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 是时候出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.60,0:44:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 伙计 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.56,0:44:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.68,0:44:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.54,0:44:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.67,0:44:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了啦 四号 呃 三号位置
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.81,0:44:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.21,0:44:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,太帅了 风就在我…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.56,0:44:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小抄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.06,0:44:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.12,0:44:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.61,0:44:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.74,0:45:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.20,0:45:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你要自己调整角度
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.63,0:45:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 回到下面来接我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.85,0:45:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.33,0:45:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.34,0:46:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢谢 我不饿
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.39,0:46:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面也不怎么防火吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.32,0:46:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.50,0:47:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本就不了解你们
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.71,0:47:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.09,0:47:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘉伯不在 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.19,0:47:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.36,0:47:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来找你的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.13,0:47:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 你瞒着我什么秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.84,0:47:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.63,0:47:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能瞒我多久呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.18,0:47:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我不知道你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.20,0:47:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论岛上发生什么 都逃不过我的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.48,0:47:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们谈谈龙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.00,0:47:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.31,0:47:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是准备告诉你 只是不知道该怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.38,0:48:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没生气吗 - 什么 这正是我的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.77,0:48:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.69,0:48:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切只会更好 等到你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.56,0:48:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次掏出奈德龙的内脏
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.85,0:48:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次把巨齿龙的头挂在长矛上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.74,0:48:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太赞了 你真让我欣慰 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.63,0:48:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来我见过的最糟糕的维京海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.32,0:48:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧丁神 真不容易 我差点就放弃你了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.87,0:48:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你一直瞒着我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.81,0:48:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的托尔雷神
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.46,0:48:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你在竞技场上表现出色
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.24,0:48:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于有话题可谈了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.28,0:48:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了样东西给你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.01,0:48:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在竞技场上保护你的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.37,0:49:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.65,0:49:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈也希望让你戴上它
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.17,0:49:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她铠甲的一半
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.33,0:49:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,匹配的设计 好让她更近些 知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.85,0:49:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,自豪地戴上吧 你值得拥有它
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.72,0:49:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信守了承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.78,0:49:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真得去睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.74,0:49:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 不错的谈话 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.06,0:49:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么明天家里见 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.17,0:49:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你过来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.70,0:49:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有这个 帽子 - 我希望
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.11,0:49:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢 这个帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.12,0:49:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.57,0:49:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边站 我这次一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.68,0:49:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 请随意
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.46,0:50:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.09,0:50:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你个半人半妖 吃耗子的呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.18,0:50:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.54,0:50:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那回头见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.30,0:50:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这么着急 - 我快迟到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.99,0:50:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 迟到个什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.48,0:50:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 安静 长老已做出了决定
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.42,0:50:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你成功了 卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.03,0:50:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以亲手杀死一条龙了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.13,0:50:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.54,0:51:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 是啊 我都等不及了 我真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.21,0:51:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.57,0:51:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收拾行李吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.02,0:51:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来咱们要去旅行了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.54,0:51:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远的旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.09,0:51:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？！你在这干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.88,0:51:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.17,0:51:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会一下子这么出色
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.60,0:51:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.71,0:51:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快说 - 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.54,0:51:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在和谁特训吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.79,0:51:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,特训 我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.05,0:51:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好没有
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.14,0:51:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这看起来是很糟 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.38,0:51:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.07,0:51:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.85,0:51:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在做额外装备
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.03,0:51:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 被你发现了 那就告诉大家好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.77,0:51:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖我回去 走吧 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.04,0:51:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.57,0:51:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下是为那些谎话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.22,0:51:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这下 是为所有其它事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.93,0:51:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.42,0:52:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.74,0:52:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.50,0:52:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没事的 没事 她是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.82,0:52:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.13,0:52:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而是我吓到他了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.98,0:52:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.59,0:52:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅丝翠 这是无牙 无牙 这是雅丝翠
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.84,0:52:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.78,0:52:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是想去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.29,0:52:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的欧丁神 不要 这…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.99,0:52:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝 把我放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:52:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你先听我解释
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.71,0:53:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要听你解释
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.83,0:53:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我不用说的 你只要看着就好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.42,0:53:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 雅丝翠
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.68,0:53:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快带我下去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.35,0:53:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙 下去吧 温柔点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说吧 没什么好怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.26,0:53:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.10,0:53:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抽什么疯 你真不乖
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.46,0:53:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他平时不会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.74,0:53:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.90,0:53:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙 你在搞什么 我们得给她留下好印象
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.21,0:53:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他在旋转了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.91,0:54:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本毫无帮助 你个没用的爬虫
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.89,0:54:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我错了 拜托快让我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.10,0:55:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我承认 这真是酷
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.80,0:56:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不可思议 他也是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.19,0:56:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.39,0:56:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝 明天就是你最后的考试
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.84,0:56:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里也清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.80,0:56:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀死一条龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.17,0:56:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用提醒我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.79,0:56:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.70,0:56:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.84,0:56:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,低下身子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.88,0:56:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙 你得带我们出去 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.52,0:56:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像在搬运猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.25,0:56:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们成什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.95,0:57:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸绝不会想到是这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.46,0:58:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的食物就这么被扔进洞里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.83,0:58:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到还真是让人感到欣慰
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一点都没吃
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.96,0:58:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.03,0:58:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计 我们得从这出去 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.78,0:58:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这就说得通了 这就好像一个大蜂巢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.00,0:58:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是工蜂 而那就是他们的蜂后
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.19,0:58:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是它统治着他们 我们去找你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.00,0:58:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.16,0:58:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 还不行 他们会杀了无牙
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.78,0:59:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅丝翠 我们得好好想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.65,0:59:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝 我们刚发现了龙的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.83,0:59:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从最早的一批祖先定居此地 我们便一直在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.84,0:59:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你却要隐瞒不说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.12,0:59:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了保护你的宠物 那条龙吗 你是认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.43,0:59:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.09,0:59:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.66,0:59:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点时间 明天我会想法子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.35,0:59:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.76,0:59:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下是因为你绑架我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.13,0:59:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下 是为了所有其它事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.63,0:59:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什么看
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.45,1:00:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我又可以在公共场合露面了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.18,1:00:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是以前有人告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.46,1:00:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝会在短短数周内 摇身一变
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.22,1:00:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为降龙训练中的佼佼者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.23,1:00:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把他绑在桅杆上
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.07,1:00:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,再开船把他送走 因为他肯定疯得不轻
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.02,1:00:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.71,1:00:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而此时此刻
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.18,1:00:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人比我更加倍感自豪与惊叹
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.60,1:00:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我的儿子成长为一名真正的维京海盗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.00,1:00:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 他已成为我们其中一员
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.30,1:00:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心那条龙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.93,1:00:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心的不是龙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.34,1:00:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.76,1:00:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,了结这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.34,1:00:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须试一下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.67,1:01:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅丝翠 要是出了意外
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.07,1:01:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保他们不会找到无牙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.68,1:01:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 但你要保证不出意外
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.30,1:01:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了 卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.07,1:01:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,将它们打个一败涂地
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.57,1:01:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我肯定选那把锤子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.07,1:01:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.50,1:02:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧 卡嗝 给它点颜色看看
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.39,1:02:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.67,1:02:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.02,1:02:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他们不同
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.87,1:02:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止这场打斗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.13,1:02:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要你们亲眼见证
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.39,1:02:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是我们想的那样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.05,1:02:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用非得杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.15,1:02:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说停止战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.14,1:02:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.32,1:02:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.64,1:03:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.47,1:03:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.16,1:03:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜煞
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.92,1:04:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 无牙 离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.04,1:04:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.32,1:04:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爸爸 他不会伤害你
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.76,1:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙 住手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.52,1:04:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.48,1:04:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住它
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.55,1:04:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 请别伤害它
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.21,1:04:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别伤害它
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.72,1:04:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它和其它龙关在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.94,1:04:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该知道
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.50,1:04:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该看出迹象
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.07,1:04:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 我们有过约定
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.64,1:04:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但那时我…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.06,1:04:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 一切都糟透了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.92,1:05:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技场的那一切…都是诡异和谎言吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.43,1:05:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞砸了 我早该告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.60,1:05:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错 冲我发火吧 但是求你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.17,1:05:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害无牙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.00,1:05:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条龙吗 你担心的就是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.74,1:05:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些差点被你害死的人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.74,1:05:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是在保护我 他并不危险
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.14,1:05:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们杀害了无数我们的族人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.33,1:05:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们杀了更多他的同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.76,1:05:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是为了自卫 仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.58,1:05:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们袭击我们是迫不得已
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.90,1:05:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不带食物回去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.75,1:05:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会被吃掉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.76,1:05:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的岛上有别的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.34,1:05:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 有一条龙 他…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.12,1:05:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的岛屿？你去过它们的巢穴吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.33,1:05:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有说到巢穴吗 - 你怎么找到的？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.05,1:05:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有 是无牙带我去的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.65,1:05:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有龙可以找到那个岛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.02,1:05:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爸爸 求你了 别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.81,1:05:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解你面对的敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.48,1:05:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你前所未见的那种
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.37,1:05:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我保证 你赢不了它
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.99,1:06:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.60,1:06:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕一次也好 你为什么就听不进去我的话呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.42,1:06:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和它们站在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.09,1:06:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是维京人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.26,1:06:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.57,1:06:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,备船
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.64,1:07:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,启航
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.39,1:07:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,向地狱犬之门进发
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.00,1:07:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔 带我们去你的老巢吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.20,1:07:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟透了 你一定难受极了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.09,1:07:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失去了所有 你父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.48,1:08:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的部落 你最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.82,1:08:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的总结
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.82,1:08:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在树林里发现他时 为什么不干脆杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.44,1:08:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样对大家都好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.24,1:08:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 换作是其他人肯定这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.52,1:08:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你偏偏下不了手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.11,1:08:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.77,1:08:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.63,1:08:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个不算答案 - 为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.53,1:08:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么突然变得对你如此重要
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.23,1:08:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想记住你现在所说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.59,1:08:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷 我是个软弱的胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.21,1:08:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连条龙都不想杀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.87,1:08:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说你不想杀？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.33,1:08:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么都好 我就是不想
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.79,1:08:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百年来 我是第一个不想杀龙的维京人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.68,1:08:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也是第一个龙骑士
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.55,1:08:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.55,1:08:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下不了手 因为他看起来和我一样害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.85,1:09:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从他身上看到了自己
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.05,1:09:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他现在一定很害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.18,1:09:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何打算
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.35,1:09:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一些蠢事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.12,1:09:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 蠢事你早就做了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.61,1:09:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就来一场疯狂的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.53,1:09:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.08,1:09:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,守好位置 保持联系
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.29,1:09:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,史推克 我刚才有所耳闻
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.96,1:09:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些船员…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.77,1:09:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们要去哪儿表示疑惑
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.77,1:09:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不包括我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.86,1:09:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你总会计划周详
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.90,1:09:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一些除我以外的人在疑惑
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.54,1:09:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否有所计划
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.74,1:09:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有 是什么计划呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.71,1:09:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到龙巢 击溃它
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.58,1:09:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 把它们放跑
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.68,1:10:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老海盗的后备计划 简单而有效
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.24,1:10:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.42,1:10:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,驶向港口
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.48,1:10:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想要被吃了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.15,1:10:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要和巨齿龙一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.84,1:10:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你脑袋灵光
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.14,1:10:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得求助世界上最致命的武器
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.48,1:10:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.17,1:10:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这个计划 - 我不…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.67,1:10:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太疯狂了 我就喜欢这点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.25,1:10:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 是什么计划
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.96,1:11:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不怎么有利于士气
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.91,1:11:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪一直不见船回来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.01,1:11:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持低姿 备好兵器
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.95,1:11:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.44,1:12:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在干什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.82,1:12:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.65,1:12:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.80,1:12:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,得加一些东西帮你驾住龙
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.60,1:12:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们敲破山门
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.70,1:12:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有龙就会蜂拥而出
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.11,1:12:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 幸好我带了备用的底衣
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.10,1:12:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论结果如何 今天要做个了断
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.21,1:13:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.56,1:13:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们胜利了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.81,1:14:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没完
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.27,1:14:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,列阵 拉石弹弓
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.40,1:14:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快撤
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.54,1:14:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我滴雷神啊…那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.37,1:14:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧丁神保佑
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.75,1:14:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射石弹
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.55,1:14:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回到船上去 - 不
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.65,1:15:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 那艘起火了 - 我真蠢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.91,1:15:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着大家逃到岛的远端
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.40,1:15:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘉伯 你也一起走
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.45,1:15:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下看着你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.96,1:15:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得你做出什么疯狂之举
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.46,1:15:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我引开那个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.11,1:15:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能拖延一点时间 让他们逃脱
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.04,1:15:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那加我一个岂不更好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.37,1:15:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来啊 - 这边
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.45,1:15:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我打 - 不 跟我打
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.39,1:15:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍夫 暴芙 注意身后
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.06,1:15:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 小鱼脚
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.20,1:16:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 我们骑着龙 全都骑着龙
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.38,1:16:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那顽固的维京死脑筋能想得到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.47,1:16:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小鱼脚 上去攻击 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.50,1:16:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,头尾的重甲是为了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.21,1:16:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛击和废碎敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.25,1:16:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小眼大鼻孔 说明它主要依靠听力和嗅觉
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.62,1:16:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 阿唠和阿脚 留在它的盲点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.77,1:16:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄些噪音扰乱它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.66,1:16:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,悍夫和暴芙 想法子找出它的死角
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.15,1:16:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,激怒它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.18,1:16:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我的专长 - 扯吧你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.15,1:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球人都知道我更会气人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.08,1:16:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我说的做 我尽快回来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.61,1:16:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们来掩护你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.99,1:16:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 傻瓜 - 呆子
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.31,1:16:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 你个螺栓
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.80,1:17:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个东西没有死角
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.68,1:17:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.71,1:17:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去帮他们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.32,1:17:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 坚持住
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.68,1:17:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起作用了 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.10,1:17:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不了巨齿龙了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.01,1:17:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻涕唠 别光傻看着
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.74,1:17:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.48,1:17:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好才怪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.89,1:17:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,错不了 怎么了 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.27,1:17:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛里进东西了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.29,1:17:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真有海盗的范儿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.55,1:18:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.74,1:18:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.86,1:18:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.44,1:19:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.45,1:19:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我所做的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.36,1:19:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.58,1:19:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必去那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.13,1:19:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是海盗 这是职业病
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.40,1:19:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 我为你骄傲
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.91,1:19:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 老爸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.03,1:19:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.65,1:19:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把鼻涕唠救出来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的活 - 我先干的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.45,1:19:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 让我来骑
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.54,1:19:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别推我 - 我要把你牙敲出来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.19,1:19:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信居然有效
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.92,1:19:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夜煞 - 趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.23,1:20:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到她了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.04,1:20:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.51,1:20:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙有翅膀 好吧 看看它能不能飞
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.72,1:20:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那招有效吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.76,1:20:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会飞
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.92,1:21:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 无牙 该消失了 上吧 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.43,1:21:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.31,1:22:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.65,1:22:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 时间到 看看是否有效
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.49,1:22:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你就这点能耐吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.00,1:22:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作一点 我们真棒 再坚持一会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.08,1:22:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 无牙 就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.79,1:23:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…不
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.24,1:23:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.65,1:23:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.79,1:23:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.94,1:24:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.06,1:24:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.61,1:24:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.33,1:24:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.14,1:25:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 你把他活着带回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.13,1:25:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你…救了我儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.89,1:25:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是救回来了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.18,1:25:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 无牙
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.81,1:25:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 真高兴再见到你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.00,1:25:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…在我的房间里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.76,1:25:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我的房间里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.13,1:25:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸知道你在这儿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.58,1:25:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.49,1:26:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙 别这样 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.57,1:26:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢你 小家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.43,1:26:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,无牙 待着别动
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.91,1:27:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计们 准备好 抓紧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.81,1:27:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.50,1:27:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 这不是真的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.44,1:27:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是 你干得很出色
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.50,1:27:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如何
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.74,1:27:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 是卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.05,1:27:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡嗝
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.75,1:27:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实证明 我们只需做一下改变
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.16,1:27:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又指着我的全身了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.18,1:27:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不全都是 那腿是我的杰作
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.60,1:27:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上一点卡嗝的光耀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.84,1:27:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得好用吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.40,1:27:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我还得做些调节
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.25,1:27:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一下 是因为你害我担心
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.16,1:27:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以后不能总这样 因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.30,1:27:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我能习惯
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.08,1:27:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.89,1:28:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夜煞 - 趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.13,1:28:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.90,1:28:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是伯克村
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.67,1:28:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年中九个月下雪 其它三个月下冰雹
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.02,1:28:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿生长的食物坚硬无味
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.10,1:28:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的人更是有过之而无不及
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.88,1:28:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的好处就是宠物
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.42,1:28:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它地方有小马或鹦鹉…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.54,1:28:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们有…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.08,1:28:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙
